cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this record and the scientific sources relevant to your application."
title: "OXYTIB: Atmospheric oxygen triple-isotope budget and inference model"
abstract: >-
  A transparent, reproducible atmospheric oxygen triple-isotope budget and
  inference model that couples altitude-resolved photochemistry to a
  conservative global O2 and biological-turnover budget. OXYTIB supports
  forward calculations, constrained one-coordinate inversions, solution
  surfaces, transient experiments, and separated uncertainty layers.
type: software
